  "@id": "ActorDefinition-TrustDemo.Role.CommunityHealthWorker",
  "@type": "fhir:ActorDefinition",
  "dcterms:identifier": "ActorDefinition/TrustDemo.Role.CommunityHealthWorker",
  "schema:name": "CommunityHealthWorker",
  "dcterms:title": "Community health worker",
  "dcterms:description": "Finds unregistered children on home visits, registers them and refers them to the clinic (J2).\n\n**Persona**: Works on foot and offline, on a cheap Android phone; registers and refers, never judges authenticity.\n\n**Played in the journeys by** (fictional):\n\n- ![Vilay](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) [Vilay](personas.html#vilay-community-health-worker--village-04-onesa), Vilay (community health worker, Village 04, Onesa)\n\n**In the user scenarios**:\n\n- [J2 — Found at home](scenarios.html#j2--found-at-home-onesa-3-weeks-later): J2a A health worker finds the baby — and reads his cards (told through Vilay); J2b Registered at home, and referred (told through Vilay)\n\n**On the device screens**: [S2 Offline QR Scan of the Foreign Cards (Vilay's phone)](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S2/); [S3 Newborn Registration & Clinic Referral (Vilay's phone)](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S3/)\n\n**Discussed in the workshop modules**: [M2 The reference architecture and where you stand](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m2/); [M3 Standards, specifications and the core data set](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m3/); [M4 Trust, credentials and wallets](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m4/); [M5 Governance, decision rights and the legal basis](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m5/)\n\n**User stories** ([all stories](scenarios.html#user-stories)):\n\n- I want to read a foreign vaccination QR offline and register the child with it, so that the clinic sees what was given before the family arrives\n- I want to refer a child whose foreign record needs checking, so that verification is done by someone who can\n- I want to register a newborn into the household offline, before civil registration, so that no newborn in my village is missed, even with no signal\n\n**Lanes and tasks in the business processes**:\n\n- [J2 Discover and refer an unregistered infant in Country B](business-processes.html#j2-discover-and-refer-an-unregistered-infant-in-country-b): Scan each QR with the CHW app; Explain the referral to the family",
